Mon Nov  9 05:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of Hardinfo2 2.3.1 for openSUSE Leap 16.0
  * GTK3 + libsoup3; OpenGL benchmark (qgears2) built with Qt5, as
    upstream recommends; Vulkan benchmark (vkgears) for X11/Wayland
  * Source repacked by prune-backgrounds.sh without the window
    background pictures (pixmaps/bg*.jpg)
  * hardinfo2-no-background-themes.patch: remove the View > Theme
    menu and always run without a background picture
  * hardinfo2 service (root data collector) shipped but not enabled;
    hardinfo2 group created through sysusers.d
